SUMMARY:Out After Dark: Exhibition by Tamara Santibañez
DESCRIPTION:Out After Dark is an exhibition by 2025-2027 Princeton Arts F
 ellow Tamara Santibañez that calls attention to the bodily negotiations
  we make to access space within shifting landscapes of law and power\, s
 peculating on how we might rethink and remake these tacit agreements. He
 re\, the body is referenced less through its visuality than by its prese
 nce moving through the exhibit\, or the materiality of its encounter wit
 h the built environment. On display are the quotidian materials that mak
 e up the borders of the constructed world\, refabricated using alternati
 ve substances. Santibañez plays with the\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/eve
 nts/2026/out-after-dark-exhibition-tamara-santibanez-30
