SUMMARY:Beyond Ivory Tower | Conversation with Dr. Ding Ding
DESCRIPTION:What can a career beyond academia look like? Join ACSSPU on O
 ctober 9\, 5:30–6:30 PM\, for “Beyond the Ivory Tower\,” a convers
 ation with Ding Ding\, PhD\, Co-Founder and CFO of Argonaut Bio. Drawing
  on her doctoral training in pharmacology and neuroscience and 22 years 
 in healthcare equity research and investment banking\, she will share he
 r journey into finance and biotech entrepreneurship. Through a talk\, mo
 derated conversation\, and audience Q&A\, we’ll explore career transit
 ions\, the intersection of science and business\, and lessons for PhD st
 udents considering opportunities beyond academia.\nhttps://www.princeton
